{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_title", "source_sha256": "1bca0e0a6d583f312770c01540d2105efb3c47ed9b7400e083440806ce82e279", "ja": "舞台裏にて　～同じ空の下～", "zh": "后台～同一片天空下～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b5cbe11189a8e2192d09951468a7f04d1cedea759f669ab20c2275fd73ff184f", "ja": "出番を待つ可奈は、レッスン後も公園で自主\n練をしてきたと言う。それでも緊張している\n様子。ひなた、伊織、美奈子は、公園と同じ\n野外だと可奈を諭す。来てくれたみんなに、\nいつも通り、笑顔のフルコースを！", "zh": "等待上场的可奈说，课程结束后也一直在公园里自主\n练习。即便如此，她看起来还是很紧张。ひなた、伊织、美奈子\n劝她说，这里和公园一样都是户外。要像平时一样，为前来\n的大家献上笑容的全套餐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "10750d851bbdb0707296b56728f3925c7638628e972d1bddbfe3c1081b13bb48", "ja": "早く可奈たちの出番来ないかな～♪\n自主レッスンの成果、見せられるかな～♪", "zh": "真希望可奈她们快点上场啊～♪\n不知道能不能展现自主练习的成果呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "1220c41c0354f2ca39adfd559475b2d1dce0e3a8f09767f94a7fa7c070341341", "ja": "可奈、自主レッスンなんてしてたの？\n全然気づかなかったわ。", "zh": "可奈，你还自己练习了啊？\n我完全没注意到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "4a3929c7e25ca646d8fb1896c2fd92e41ae25d9527cacc74ca9d2689f832ef5f", "ja": "えへへ、じつはレッスンのあと、公園で……。\n外で歌うのって気持ち良いですよね～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，其实练习结束后，我在公园里……在外面唱歌感觉很舒服呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "92a9bff096da5fca2f0940a362c956639c532fc2f2517cc93328bb99b12b5a67", "ja": "そうだよね！　家で食べるご飯もおいしいけど、\n外で食べるともっとおいしい、みたいな感じで♪", "zh": "就是嘛！在家吃的饭也很好吃，不过在外面吃就感觉更好吃，就像这样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "f5b882074d1b3f27cdc88773de89a62e50455620803383c1e2d4763ec56fa34e", "ja": "あたしもよく畑で歌ってたよぉ。\n今日も外のステージだから、なんだかなつかしいべさ。", "zh": "我以前也经常在田里唱歌呢。今天也是户外舞台，总觉得有点怀念啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "b212fdbb171ac507a93bf023b242f6ed8843456f5e766cc44bf62fea0238350d", "ja": "たまには外でのライブもいいわよね。\n外ならではの演出もあるみたいだし♪", "zh": "偶尔在户外举办演唱会也不错呢。\n听说还有只有户外才能做到的演出♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "5d1ba141f13de17d6a17313b50340d97c0ea4e51f1317e12b19299fde96e7cfe", "ja": "ああ！　でもでも、いつもと違うって思ったら、緊張\nしてきちゃった……。レッスン通りできるかなぁ？", "zh": "啊！不过不过，一想到和往常不一样，就开始紧张了……能像练习时那样做好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "5eb1ecfd3b5ca9646d58ba42182821d03e618a43204bfb032621da91f2a5f79d", "ja": "可奈ちゃん、大丈夫だよぉ。可奈ちゃんの頑張りは、\nちゃあんと、お天道様が見てるベさ♪", "zh": "可奈，没事的呀。可奈你的努力，太阳可是看得一清二楚呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "71318667ccb3641c9b3695d6215f55c770c2ec3156ebc60dff87196e08fa1ccd", "ja": "むしろ、よかったんじゃない？\n自主レッスンの時と同じ、外で歌えるんだもの。", "zh": "反而不是挺好的吗？\n能像自主练习时一样，在外面唱歌呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "de078ff78b9e05ff96100a5fcaca3e460d91094e5ffdfbcf8c6b8ada7cb3ddf5", "ja": "そうだよ可奈ちゃん。ここは公園だと思って、\nレッスンを思い出して。いつも通りで大丈夫♪", "zh": "对呀，可奈。就把这里当成公园，想想平时练习的感觉。像往常一样就没问题啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "9f39e276bc423c72118f35cd53d3d5af099b13e9119b7156a58587a84e3ee3c0", "ja": "ひなたちゃん、伊織さん、美奈子さん……！\nえへへ、そうですね！　いつも通り頑張ろう～、お～♪", "zh": "小雏、伊织姐、美奈子姐……！\n嘿嘿，对哦！就像平时一样加油吧～，噢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "6884b51e3662e8fe0cdf422142a9d3c8814b3e278d1e4a5c895e397de5490761", "ja": "切り替えが早いわね……。ま、いいわ。\n私と同じステージに立つんだから、そうこなくっちゃ♪", "zh": "转换得真快啊……算了。  \n既然要和我站在同一个舞台上，就该这样才对♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1012_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "d940a4bd15a64f6911e6a5ed472f7ec53b7c3031c3327a7a205f3461dec2b62a", "ja": "そろそろ出番みたいだねぇ。\nそれじゃ、みんなでいつも通り、頑張るべさ！", "zh": "好像差不多该我们上场了呢。\n那么，大家也像平时一样，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_09_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "694c991175a1d3d8509f6d26410fb225b5dddd3168cfc7ad2a2d02683f1ea7f9", "ja": "うんっ！　私たち4人で、来てくれたみんなに\n笑顔のフルコースを振舞っちゃおう♪", "zh": "嗯！我们4个人，要为到场的大家奉上满满的笑容全餐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
